Short:        Literate Programming with C and C++
Author:       Andreas Scherer et.al.
Uploader:     <scherer genesis informatik rwth-aachen de>
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Files:        cwebbin-p13.lha, cwebbin-p13.readme


This is the final update for the CWEB system on the Amiga.

In order to fully exploit Silvio Levy's CWEB system for `Literate
Programming with C/C++' you should aquire the original distribution

   ftp.dante.de:/pub/tex/web/c_cpp/cweb/cweb-3.4c.tar.gz

and add the contents of the CWEBBIN distribution.  Care has been taken
to avoid any conflicts in file names.  Detailed information about what
to install where is given in the accompanying documentation.


Happy CWEBbin'!


September, 1995.

